From 0000000000000000000000000000000000000000 Mon Sep 17 00:00:00 2001
From: bpereira <bpereira@cloudflare.com>
Date: Fri, 18 Sep 2026 21:34:18 +0100
Subject: [PATCH 5/5] Expand horizontal tabs to CSS tab stops

Recognize horizontal tabs in the text engine and expand preserved tabs to
CSS tab stops during line layout. Thread the configured tab size through
text styles and update cluster and glyph advances so painting, selection
and hit testing agree. Use a space glyph where available to leave the tab
invisible.
